# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# habitat-radiomics-pca-lnm
#
# What IS committed:
#   src/ verify/ tools/ docs/ config/
#   data/synthetic/       fabricated data, pipeline demonstration only
#   data/*.csv            AGGREGATE results only (no patient rows)
#   data/MANIFEST.json    metadata
#   results/README.md     the directory is otherwise generated
#
# ★ What is NOT committed, and must never be:
#   any individual-level (IPD) table — the trial registration states
#   "IPD sharing: No".  The per-patient clinical, feature, score, identifier-key
#   and SHAP tables live in a controlled institutional store outside git.
#   Run outputs derived from them (results/tables, results/figures) likewise.
#
#   raw imaging, model weights, scratch files, caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- individual-level (IPD) tables: never commit -------------------------
# the real tables are placed in data/ only in the controlled environment; the
# synthetic set lives under data/synthetic/ and is whitelisted at the bottom
data/clinical.csv
data/clinical_workspace.csv
data/labels.csv
data/analysis_set.csv
data/model_inputs.csv
data/scores_highprec.csv
data/fullprec_scores.csv
data/cases_with_ids.csv
data/candidate_features.csv
data/scores/
data/features/
data/shap/
data/k_runs/

# ---- run outputs derived from individual-level data ----------------------
results/tables/
results/figures/
results/logs/
results/*.json

